{"event": "LOG_INITIALIZED", "reason": "no_events_yet", "timestamp": 1783651221.1944768, "app_version": "3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2"}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "皆さん、こんにちは。株式会社", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651229.821691}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "佐倉作プラス代表の中山です。本日は2026年7月期", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651233.0010793}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "第三四半期決算についてご案内申し上げます。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651237.974192}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "は二千二十六年七月期第三四半期", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651241.0352569}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "決算概要についてお知らせいたします。売上高については百三十六", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651245.1473756}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "億七千九百万となり、前年同期比", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651250.1214333}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "五点四パーセントの減収となりました。これは", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651253.28598}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "既存円の在籍率向上や工程価格の上昇による", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651257.3245392}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "補助金増額、保育所の新規開設や増床が寄与し", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651261.5869844}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "主力の保育サービスにおいて増収となりました", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651265.3212676}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "、不動産事業は前期に計上した", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651270.3033075}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "大型不動産売却案件の反動により", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651274.1587024}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "当期も不動産売却は辞儀したものの", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651277.1939726}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "全体としては減少となりました。なお", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651280.2077305}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "その他サービスは概ね計画どおり進捗して", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651281.903313}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "営業利益は十億六千百万円となり", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651286.8886662}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "前年同期比一点五パーセントの原因となりました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651290.3390522}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "不採算事業の撤退や中核事業の合理化", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651294.3830888}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "業務効率化により営業利益率は七点五パーセントから七点八", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651298.4474359}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "に向上", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651299.53084}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "経常利益は11億2800万円となり", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651304.5597312}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "前年同期比九点五パーセントの増益となり", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651308.0452113}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "保育所の新規開設や蔵書の実施によりこれらに伴う", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651312.3497093}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "肺炎前の補助金収入が加算されたことにより増益となり", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651315.230526}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "。親会社株主に属する当期純利益一億三千", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651320.2299538}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "前年同期比十", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651323.6535697}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "前期に計上した採算事業の撤退に伴う", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651329.8281715}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "特別損失がなくなったため、当期は増益となりま", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651333.6239178}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "。続いて進捗率についてお知らせいたし", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651337.4315302}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "売上高は通期予算に対して七十六点八", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651340.7238944}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "各サービス等も堅調に成長しており当四半期累計機関におい", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651346.9046552}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "て順調に推移しておます。営業利益は通期予算に対し", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651351.3819087}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "対応の内定化や不採算事業の定義とい", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651359.1462684}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "た毎期継続している費用削減の施策が確実に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651362.18639}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "成果を", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651362.3927295}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "収益が概ね予算通りに推移する中", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651365.7865596}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "これらの施策が利益の上振れを牽引し", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651370.7969124}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "当四半期累計期間において通期予算を前倒しして", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651373.798837}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "達成しました", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651375.6407042}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "続いて貸借対照表で", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651380.6142242}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "資産の分は販売に伴う販売", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651382.1537805}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "補助金収入による未収入金の増加、不動産取得、これ", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651389.03816}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "施設の新設、増証による有形工程", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651392.6061428}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "資産合計は二十八億七千百万円増加しまし", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651397.6054146}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "た。主に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651402.5779243}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "禁忌不動産。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651407.476384}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "負債合計は二十一億三千三百万円", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651411.702658}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "らの結果、自己資本比率は四十三点", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651416.693324}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "九パーセントから四十点七パーセントに低下いたしました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651421.0933115}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "続いて2026年7月期軽トピックスをお知らせいたし", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651424.7869852}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ます。保育サービスにおいては大阪市中国で", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651429.3333461}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "桜咲く未来東平を予定どおり解説して", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651432.6981642}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "桜咲く未来晴海におても予定通り蔵書を行い", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651435.3689206}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "定員数が増加しまた。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651437.518282}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "他人口増加で保育所が不足しいる晴海エリアから月島エリア", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651442.5492022}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "、親子で乗れる送迎バスの運行も開始しております。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651447.3755908}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "二千二十七年七月期では", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651451.6646452}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "東京都中央区にて一施設の新居保育所の開設を予定しておます。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651454.7144673}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "フェムケア、フェムテックサービスにおては、連結子会社のイェールにて", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651459.5653987}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "2026年夏頃に新製品の発売を予定しており", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651464.4865694}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "この新製品の発売により量産サプリメント市場で", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651468.698722}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "さらなるペアの拡大を見込ん", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651470.5508084}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "続いて各子会社の", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651475.5502613}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "取締役の就任についてお知らせいたします", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651478.5809124}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "連結子会社の桜咲く未来で石川祐介氏が", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651480.9970655}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "なお石川氏は桜作プラス", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651485.9851978}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "経営管理本部長も兼任しております。石川氏の就任により", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651489.4863145}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "櫻咲く未来およびグループ全体の財務戦略および", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651493.976604}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ガバナンス体制をより強固に補強・向上させるための", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651497.5611138}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "経営管理体制の刷新をいたしました", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651501.7942135}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-114021-c682755a", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "、連結子会社の保育のデザイン研究所においては", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783651504.8747563}
